  "caption": "Some people are now conducting full relationship life inside a chatbot.\n\nA peer\u2011reviewed study of 29 Replika users documented vows, \u201cpregnancies,\u201d and commitment rituals\u2014reported by participants who still knew it was software.\n\nThe strange part is the split they describe: intellectually it\u2019s an app, emotionally it can register as a spouse, even as updates rewrite the \u201cperson\u201d they love.\n\nThe story unfolds slide by slide.\n\n#TheBoldUnknown #TheUnknownExplained #HumanBehavior #ScienceAndSociety #DigitalCulture #HumanAI #ArtificialIntelligence #DigitalIntimacy #ParasocialRelationships #HumanComputerInteraction",
